## Phase 5 — Export & Sharing (2–3 days)

> Goal: Turn evaluation results into discussable artifacts.

### 5.1 Export as JSON/Markdown + Report Cards

- "Export JSON" button: download complete experiment config + metrics + per-run results
- "Export Markdown" button: formatted report with tables and charts descriptions
- "Share Link" button: Generate a short ID (e.g., `nanoid`), store the config + summary state in **Upstash Redis** (already configured) with a 7-day TTL, and return a clean shortlink (`/report/abc-1234`). Avoids 414 URI Too Long errors from massive base64 strings.

#### Files
- **[NEW]** Frontend export utility — client-side JSON/Markdown generation
- **[MODIFY]** Frontend results page — add export/share buttons

