## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests

| Phase | Test | Command |
|---|---|---|
| 1.2 | CI workflow validates itself | Push a test PR and verify GitHub Actions runs green |
| 2.1 | Manifest generation test | `cd backend && python -m pytest tests/test_experiment_lifecycle.py -v` (extend existing test) |
| 2.2 | Tag filtering test | `cd backend && python -m pytest tests/test_api.py -v` (extend existing test) |
| 3.1 | Token counting test | `cd backend && python -m pytest tests/ -k "test_cost or test_token" -v` (new test) |
| 4.1 | Failure classifier test | `cd backend && python -m pytest tests/ -k "test_failure" -v` (new test) |
| 6.1 | Provider router test | `cd backend && python -m pytest tests/ -k "test_router" -v` (new test with MockEngine) |
| 7.1 | Red-team scoring test | `cd backend && python -m pytest tests/ -k "test_robustness" -v` (new test) |

### Manual Verification
- **Phase 1**: Verify ADR links render in README on GitHub. Push a test commit to check CI badge.
- **Phase 2**: Create experiment → verify `run_manifest` JSON in DB → click "Reproduce" → verify form pre-fills correctly.
- **Phase 3**: Run experiment → verify token counts appear in results grid → verify cost card shows non-zero values.
- **Phase 4**: Run experiment with some wrong answers → verify failure mode labels appear → click a failure to expand trace view.
- **Phase 5**: Click "Export JSON" → verify downloaded file is valid. Click "Share Link" → open in incognito → verify it loads.
- **Phase 6**: Run experiment with `provider: openrouter` → verify fallback to HF if rate-limited.
- **Phase 7**: Run red-team experiment → verify Safety Score card appears on dashboard.

---

## Recommended Execution Order

```
Phase 1 (2-3 days) → Phase 4 (3-4 days) → Phase 3 (3-4 days) → Phase 2 (3-4 days) → Phase 5 (2-3 days) → Phase 6 (4-5 days) → Phase 7 (7-10 days)
```

> **Rationale**: Phase 1 (ADRs + CI) gives instant credibility. Phase 4 (failure analysis) is the most impressive "quick" feature. Phase 3 (cost tracking) builds the data needed for Phase 5/6. Phase 7 features are independent stretch goals.

**Total estimated effort**: ~25–33 days for all phases. Pick phases based on interview timeline:

| Time Available | Recommended Phases |
|---|---|
| **1 week** | Phase 1 + Phase 4 |
| **2 weeks** | Phase 1 + Phase 4 + Phase 3 + Phase 5 |
| **3 weeks** | Phase 1–5 + Phase 6 |
| **4+ weeks** | All phases |
